 ploads/event/wcat%20cat%20hope%20style_20260925173058722091.jpg
DESCRIPTION:We recently discovered that several of our members are talente
 d local artists! In support of Rebecca Bennett\, let’s come together to 
 view some incredible art and connect with fellow members who share like-mi
 nded views. During these hyperbolic times\, we all need moments dedicated 
 to art\, beauty\, and good company. The location and further details will 
 be provided upon registration. Light refreshments will be served. We look 
 forward to bringing our community together!
LOCATION:Belvidere\, Belvidere\, NJ\, 07823
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/ionj/event/1045855/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible One NJ (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
