 ng
DESCRIPTION:We are partnering with several grassroots group and Democratic
  Messaging Project to rollout anti-Kean / pro-democracy / Vote for Bennett
  messages via a billboard truck across CD7. Please join us across the dist
 rict for visibilities\, literature drop and voter information. Join us in 
 Warren County on one or all three days! Bring your signs\, enthusiasm and 
 costumes. Location and details will be emailed. Interested volunteers\, pl
 ease reach out to us via wcatnj@gmail.com.
LOCATION:Warren County\, Hackettstown\, NJ\, 07840
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/ionj/event/1034546/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible One NJ (Mobilize)
